@host = http://localhost:5102

### ====================================================================
### 1. AUTENTICACIÓN (AUTH)
### ====================================================================

### 1.1 [201 Created] Registro de nuevo usuario (rol por defecto: Recepcionista)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "nuevo.recepcionista@gimnasio.com",
  "clave": "Clave123!"
}

### 1.2 [409 Conflict] Registro con correo repetido (Regla de negocio)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "gerente@gimnasio.com",
  "clave": "Clave123!"
}

### 1.3 [401 Unauthorized] Login con credenciales incorrectas (clave equivocada o correo inexistente)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "gerente@gimnasio.com",
  "clave": "ClaveIncorrecta!"
}

### 1.4 [200 OK] Login como RECEPCIONISTA (guarda token)
# @name loginRecepcionista
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "recepcion@gimnasio.com",
  "clave": "Clave123!"
}

### Extraer token de Recepcionista
@tokenRecepcionista = {{loginRecepcionista.response.body.token}}

### 1.5 [200 OK] Login como GERENTE (guarda token)
# @name loginGerente
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "gerente@gimnasio.com",
  "clave": "Clave123!"
}

### Extraer token de Gerente
@tokenGerente = {{loginGerente.response.body.token}}

### 1.6 [401 Unauthorized] Obtener perfil sin token
GET {{host}}/api/auth/perfil

### 1.7 [200 OK] Obtener perfil con token de Recepcionista (Claims: correo y rol)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}

### 1.8 [200 OK] Obtener perfil con token de Gerente (Claims: correo y rol)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}


### ====================================================================
### 2. PLANES (PLANES)
### ====================================================================

### 2.1 [200 OK] Listar planes (PÚBLICO - Sin token)
GET {{host}}/api/planes?activo=true&precioMax=500

### 2.2 [200 OK] Obtener plan por ID (PÚBLICO - Sin token)
GET {{host}}/api/planes/1

### 2.3 [404 Not Found] Obtener plan inexistente (PÚBLICO)
GET {{host}}/api/planes/999

### 2.4 [401 Unauthorized] Socios de un plan SIN token (Requiere [Authorize])
GET {{host}}/api/planes/1/socios

### 2.5 [200 OK] Socios de un plan CON token (Recepcionista o Gerente)
GET {{host}}/api/planes/1/socios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}

### 2.6 [401 Unauthorized] Crear plan SIN token
POST {{host}}/api/planes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Plan Black",
  "precio": 350.00,
  "duracionMeses": 6,
  "activo": true
}

### 2.7 [403 Forbidden] Crear plan con rol RECEPCIONISTA (Requiere rol Gerente)
POST {{host}}/api/planes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Plan Black",
  "precio": 350.00,
  "duracionMeses": 6,
  "activo": true
}

### 2.8 [400 Bad Request] Crear plan con datos inválidos (rol Gerente)
POST {{host}}/api/planes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "X",
  "precio": -10,
  "duracionMeses": 30
}

### 2.9 [409 Conflict] Crear plan con nombre duplicado (rol Gerente)
POST {{host}}/api/planes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Mensual Básico",
  "precio": 99.90,
  "duracionMeses": 1
}

### 2.10 [201 Created] Crear plan exitoso con rol GERENTE
POST {{host}}/api/planes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Plan Semestral VIP",
  "precio": 520.00,
  "duracionMeses": 6,
  "activo": true
}

### 2.11 [403 Forbidden] Actualizar plan con rol RECEPCIONISTA (Requiere rol Gerente)
PUT {{host}}/api/planes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Mensual Básico Editado",
  "precio": 99.90,
  "duracionMeses": 1,
  "activo": true
}

### 2.12 [409 Conflict] Desactivar un plan que tiene socios (rol Gerente)
PUT {{host}}/api/planes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Mensual Básico",
  "precio": 89.90,
  "duracionMeses": 1,
  "activo": false
}

### 2.13 [204 NoContent] Actualizar plan exitoso con rol GERENTE
PUT {{host}}/api/planes/5
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Promo Invierno 2026",
  "precio": 129.90,
  "duracionMeses": 2,
  "activo": false
}

### 2.14 [403 Forbidden] Eliminar plan con rol RECEPCIONISTA (Requiere rol Gerente)
DELETE {{host}}/api/planes/5
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}

### 2.15 [409 Conflict] Eliminar plan que tiene socios inscritos (rol Gerente)
DELETE {{host}}/api/planes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}

### 2.16 [204 NoContent] Eliminar plan sin socios con rol GERENTE
DELETE {{host}}/api/planes/5
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}


### ====================================================================
### 3. SOCIOS (SOCIOS)
### ====================================================================

### 3.1 [401 Unauthorized] Listar socios SIN token (Requiere [Authorize])
GET {{host}}/api/socios

### 3.2 [200 OK] Listar socios con rol RECEPCIONISTA
GET {{host}}/api/socios?planId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}

### 3.3 [200 OK] Obtener socio por ID con rol RECEPCIONISTA
GET {{host}}/api/socios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}

### 3.4 [404 Not Found] Obtener socio inexistente
GET {{host}}/api/socios/999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}

### 3.5 [400 Bad Request] Inscribir socio con DNI o datos inválidos
POST {{host}}/api/socios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombres": "A",
  "dni": "123",
  "edad": 10,
  "planId": 0
}

### 3.6 [409 Conflict] Inscribir socio con DNI repetido
POST {{host}}/api/socios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombres": "Socio Duplicado",
  "dni": "45781236",
  "edad": 25,
  "planId": 1
}

### 3.7 [201 Created] Inscribir socio con rol RECEPCIONISTA
POST {{host}}/api/socios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombres": "Mateo Gutierrez Quispe",
  "dni": "76123489",
  "email": "mateo.gutierrez@mail.com",
  "edad": 23,
  "planId": 1
}

### 3.8 [204 NoContent] Actualizar socio con rol RECEPCIONISTA
PUT {{host}}/api/socios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombres": "Luis Mendoza Quispe Actualizado",
  "dni": "45781236",
  "email": "luis.actualizado@mail.com",
  "edad": 29,
  "planId": 1
}

### 3.9 [403 Forbidden] Eliminar socio con rol RECEPCIONISTA (Requiere rol Gerente)
DELETE {{host}}/api/socios/6
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecepcionista}}

### 3.10 [204 NoContent] Eliminar socio con rol GERENTE
DELETE {{host}}/api/socios/6
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}

### 3.11 [404 Not Found] Eliminar socio inexistente con rol GERENTE
DELETE {{host}}/api/socios/999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}
